            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Improved

- **Fewer Keychain questions.** Starseed is now signed with its own certificate, so macOS recognizes it from one version to the next. After this update, macOS asks one last time whether Starseed may use your Nexus API key: click **Always Allow**, and future updates won't ask again.
]]></description>
